B.Sb=s(["Last updated: October 2026","This app does not collect, transmit, or sell any personal data. There is no account and no sign-up.","Everything you create \u2014 rosters, saves, character sheets, custom monsters and subclasses, theme preferences \u2014 is stored locally: on-device for native builds, in your browser's local storage for the web version. None of it is sent anywhere.","LAN multiplayer connects directly between devices on your own local network. No data passes through any server operated by the developer or anyone else.","Apart from LAN multiplayer, the only network requests this app makes are for the files it needs to display itself. On every platform it downloads its display fonts from Google Fonts (fonts.gstatic.com) the first time they are needed, and the web version also loads its rendering engine from Google (www.gstatic.com) and is hosted on GitHub Pages. Like any website, those services can see standard request information such as your IP address and browser type, under their own privacy policies. None of the content you create is part of those requests, and the developer does not collect this information.","This app has no analytics, no crash reporting, and no advertising.","If a future version changes any of this \u2014 for example, by adding optional cloud sync \u2014 this policy will be updated first, and any such feature will be opt-in."],t.s)
