B.T0=s(["Last updated: October 2026",'This app is provided "as is," without warranty of any kind, and is currently in beta \u2014 features, data formats, and behavior may change between versions, and bugs should be expected.',"You are solely responsible for any content you create, type, or paste into this app \u2014 custom monsters, subclasses, character sheets, or imported files. By adding content, you confirm you own it or otherwise have the right to use it. Don't paste in copyrighted material \u2014 such as text from official rulebooks \u2014 that isn't already covered by the open licenses listed in this app's About & Licensing section.","D&D 5e SRD content, the Black Flag Roleplaying SRD, and related material are used under their respective open licenses (see About & Licensing on the home screen). This app is not affiliated with or endorsed by Wizards of the Coast or Kobold Press.","The developer is not liable for any loss of data, disruption to your game session, or other damages arising from use of this app.","Continued use of this app means you accept these terms."],t.s)
